{"5043340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Misdealt", "steam_appid": 5043340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Reclaim your birthright</i></strong><br><br>Once a powerful King, you lost your crown on a deceitful game of cards. Now, you have to trick and outsmart your way through the lowest scum in all the lands in order to reclaim your throne; whether you face guards, thieves or even monsters that surpass humanity, all are just obstacles in your resurgence to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i><br>Explore the shadiest corners in the Kingdom</i></strong><br><br> From the deep, rotten sewers, all the way through the god forgotten prison and up onto the unrelenting Royal Fortress, you will get to know the dark underworld of what you once used to rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong><i>Four suits, a myriad of play styles</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Inspired by the Spanish deck of cards, each suit brings a specific tool to your battles,such as healing, dealing damage and protecting yourself; mixing &amp; matching the right cards will be the key to your victory over your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>There is no honor amongst the lawless</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your cards are not alone in this journey; you have at your disposition many tools and gadgets to outmaneuver your foes: Look at their hand, invalidate their moves or even steal their cards. Any and all means are valid as long as you are winning.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>Reclaim your birthright</i></strong><br><br>Once a powerful King, you lost your crown on a deceitful game of cards. Now, you have to trick and outsmart your way through the lowest scum in all the lands in order to reclaim your throne; whether you face guards, thieves or even monsters that surpass humanity, all are just obstacles in your resurgence to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i><br>Explore the shadiest corners in the Kingdom</i></strong><br><br> From the deep, rotten sewers, all the way through the god forgotten prison and up onto the unrelenting Royal Fortress, you will get to know the dark underworld of what you once used to rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <strong><i>Four suits, a myriad of play styles</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Inspired by the Spanish deck of cards, each suit brings a specific tool to your battles,such as healing, dealing damage and protecting yourself; mixing &amp; matching the right cards will be the key to your victory over your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>There is no honor amongst the lawless</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your cards are not alone in this journey; you have at your disposition many tools and gadgets to outmaneuver your foes: Look at their hand, invalidate their moves or even steal their cards. Any and all means are valid as long as you are winning.</p>", "short_description": "Win your crown back! Build a strong deck, explore a mystical world and expand your abilities in this medieval fantasy adventure where everything comes down to the cards. And if luck isn't on your side, bend the rules to ensure your ultimate victory!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043340/3482a346e4305e323d63124b67114053ec5ed618/header.jpg?t=1786131665", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043340/ff65f75237a02c263c4b231f071c551b07b07ae1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786131665", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5043340/ff65f75237a02c263c4b231f071c551b07b07ae1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=178613